# held/civil/scroll: the sealed letter (art weapon 11) at rest in the near hand (PROPS, P2b): a rolled parchment tied
# with a ribbon in the person's accent (the court's colour) under the fist. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. On the grip and
# the held channel (LOCO and RUN; `drop` by a corpse). Front and back: hanging upright under the fist; right: carried
# pointing forward and down; left (the far hand, hidden): its end peeking behind the hip.
use person
legend V linen 0
legend W linen 1
legend X linen 2
legend Y linen 3
legend Z linen 4
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4
legend I metal2 0
legend J metal2 4
body man woman
role held scroll
layer neck
anchor grip
keys held
z 40

view D key rest origin 1 -1
